{# _shared/_includes/case/details/history-panel.njk

   Moved out of the Outline tab's "Confidential Information to Prosecutor"
   section per stakeholder feedback — showing the unredacted original text
   there was misleading and the wrong placement. Lives in its own "History"
   tab instead (see main-tabs.njk). Logic unchanged: only ever appears once
   factualSummaryOriginal has been frozen by a first edit or redaction (see
   captureOriginalIfUnset in case--outline.js) — before that, there's
   nothing to show. #}
{% if _case.factualSummaryOriginal %}
  {% set originalCircumstancesHtml %}
    {% for paragraph in _case.factualSummaryOriginal.split('\n\n') %}
<p class="govuk-body">{{ paragraph }}</p>
    {% endfor %}
  {% endset %}

  {{ govukSummaryList({
    card: {
      title: {
        html: 'Summary of circumstances of offence(s) (unredacted)'
      }
    },
    rows: [
      { key: { text: "Added on 24 May 2026" }, value: { html: originalCircumstancesHtml } }
    ]
  }) }}
{% endif %}
